# Local scratch: throwaway harnesses, one-shot rollout scripts, PR drafts.
# This repo ships only reusable workflows, so none of that belongs on main —
# a committed test suite no CI step runs is false confidence, and a one-shot
# rollout script is correct exactly once. Keep such things outside the tree.
scratchpad/

